OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWinds strengthening to gale
OL,6,Fforce with a risk of storm force
OL,7,Fespecially around exposed coasts. A
OL,8,Flargely cloudy day with light patchy
OL,9,Frain in the morning but heavier at
OL,10,Ftimes in the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with heavy rain
OL,13,Fspreading east during the evening.
OL,14,FTurning drier overnight with a few
OL,15,Flight showers and clearer spells
OL,16,Flater. Gales easing, though remaining
OL,17,Fwindy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
