OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FSome bright or sunny spells
OL,6,Fdeveloping during the day but these
OL,7,Finterspersed with cloudier conditions
OL,8,Fand showers, which may be heavy. Still
OL,9,Fbreezy but winds generally easing.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,12,Fspells and showers early Friday but
OL,13,Fdrier and clearer later. Saturday and
OL,14,FSunday will be mostly dry with bright
OL,15,For sunny spells and light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
